    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaj ocamo ker ma mwaka me ditte pyeraryo, ci obedo ka loc i Jerucalem pi mwaka apar wiye abicel. Pe obedo ka tiyo gia ma nen atir i wan Rwot, kit ma kwarone Daudi yam otiyo-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento obedo ka lubo kit pa luker me Icrael. En otiyo cal jok aliya pi lwak Baal-gu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obedo ka waŋo odok eceta i nota pa wod pa Kinom, dok owaŋo wode me gityer, kun lubo kwede tim me kwer pa rok ducu ma Rwot yam oryemogi woko ki i nyim jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En obedo ka tyero gitum ki waŋo odok eceta i waŋ jogi ma i wi godi, ki i wi cere, ki i waŋ ayweya ducu ma po te oluk-gu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ic 7.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pienno Rwot Lubaŋane omiyo en i ciŋ kabaka me Ciria, ma oloyo en ci oyako jo mapol ki i kin lwakke oterogi woko wa i Damaciko. Dok gimiyo en i ciŋ kabaka me Icrael, ma oloyo en kun oneko lwak jone madwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien Peka wod pa Remalia oneko jo alip miya ki pyeraryo i Juda i nino acel, gin ducu gubedo twoni lweny matego, pien onoŋo doŋ gutyeko bwoto Rwot woko, ma Lubaŋa pa kwarogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Jikri twon oteka me Epraim, oneko Maaceya wod pa kabaka, ki Ajrikam ma ladit ma loyo i gaŋ kal, ki Elkana ma en aye lawaŋ kabaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Icrael guyako jo alip mi ya aryo ki i kin utmegigi, mon, awobe, ki anyira; dok guyako jamigi mapol ci gutero i Camaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lanebi pa Rwot onoŋo tye kunnu, ma nyiŋe Oded; en ocito ka rwatte ki mony ma onoŋo ocito i Camaria, ci owaco botgi ni, “Nenu, kiniga omako Rwot Lubaŋa pa kwariwu i kom jo Juda ci omiyogi i ciŋwu, ento wun wunekogi ki akemo madwoŋ mada ma pire owinnye wa i polo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kombeddi tamwu tye ka rido lwak ma i Juda ki Jerucalem, co ki mon, wek gubed opiiwu. Pe wutye ki bal ma okemowu i kom Rwot Lubaŋawu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ wuwiny lokka, ci wucwal jo ma wukwanyogi-ni gudok cen; gin utmegiwu, wudwokgi ka ma wukwanyogi ki iye-ni, pien akemo pa Rwot tye i komwu madwoŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ludito mukene me Epraim, gin aye Ajaria wod pa Yokanan, Berekia wod pa Mecilemot, lekijikia wod pa Calum, ki Amaca wod pa Kadlai, gucuŋ gujuko jo ma gua i mony, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kun giwacci, “Pe wubikelo jo ma giyakogi wa kany, pien tamwu tye me tiŋo alii bot Rwot kun wamedo i kom balwa ki alii ma doŋ watyeko tiŋone-ni. Aliiwa doŋ tye dwoŋ, dok bene akemo pa Rwot magwar tye i kom Icrael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno jo ma gin lumony-nyi guweko dano ki jami ducu ma guyakogi i nyim rwodi ki i nyim lwak mucokke ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma gicoyo nyiŋgi malo-nu gua gutero dano ma giyakogi-ni, kacel ki jami, ci guruko jo ducu ma i kingi ma gitye no no munero ki boŋŋi ma lumony onoŋo guyako. Gurukogi ki boŋŋi, ka gimiyogi war tyen wa ki cam bene ki ginamata-gu, dok guwiro komgi ki moo. Lacen gutiŋo jo magoro i kingi ki kana, guterogi wa bot jo tugi ma i Jeriko, gaŋ me otit, ka gudok cen i Camaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno kabaka Akaj ocwalo kwena bot kabaka me Aciria kun lego kony ki bote; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien onoŋo jo Edom gumonyo jo Juda ci guloyogi bene, guyako jo mogo i kingi, guterogi i opii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Piliciti bene gumonyo gaŋi ma i Cepela ki Negeb me Juda, Betcemec, Aijalon, Gederot, Coko ki gaŋi matino ma i ŋete ducu, Timna ki gaŋi matino ma i ŋete ducu, Gimjo ki gaŋi matino ma i ŋete ducu; ci gubedo iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot odwoko Juda woko piny pi Akaj kabaka me Icrael, pien obedo ka timo tim mogo me carocaro i Juda, pien onayo wan Rwot woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi meno omiyo Tiglat-pilecer kabaka me Aciria obino ka lweny i kome, ci otime malit ma kaka miye kony ma twero miye tek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaj okwanyo jami ma i ot pa Rwot ki ma i ot pa kabaka ki ma i ot pa rwodi, ci oculo mucoro bot kabaka me Aciria; ento pe omedo ki noŋo iye kit kony mo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma doŋ can odiye en kabaka Akaj acel-li omedde ameda ki ŋayo waŋ Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En otyero gitum bot lwak lubaŋa pa jo Damaciko ma onoŋo guloye, kun wacci, “Pien lwak lubaŋa pa luker me Ciria okonyogi, an abityero gitum botgi wek gukonya bene,” Ento gukelo can ma otyeko en ki jo Icrael ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci Akaj ocoko jami ducu ma gitiyo kwede i ot pa Lubaŋa ocako ŋido woko matitino gin jami magi ma onoŋo gitiyo kwedgi i ot pa Lubaŋa, ka dok oloro doggola me ot pa Rwot woko; cut otiyo keno tyer mapol pire kene ma romo i Jerucalem ducu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I gaŋ acel acel ma i Juda oketo iye waŋ jogi ka ma giwaŋo iye odok eceta bot lwak lubaŋa mukene-gu, ma omiyo kiniga omako Rwot Lubaŋa pa kwarine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lok kom Akaj mudoŋŋe ducu, ki kite ducu, nia i acakkine nio i agikkine, gityeko coyone i buk pa Luker me Juda ki me Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.28"
              },
